 in citric acid with 20&#x02009;min standing</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">1&#x0002f;500</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Masakazu Fukushima, Saitama, Japan</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Epidermal growth factor receptor (EGFR)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">4 &#x000d7; 4&#x02009;min microwave in citric acid with 20&#x02009;min standing</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">1&#x0002f;20</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x00023;NCL-L-EGFR, Novocastra Labs Ltd, UK</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Carbonic anhydrase-9 (CA-9)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">None</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">1&#x0002f;50</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Adrian Harris, Oxford, UK</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Glucose transporter-1 (GLUT-1)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">3 &#x000d7; 4&#x02009;min microwave in citric acid with 10&#x02009;min standing</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">I&#x0002f;200</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x00023;A3536, DAKO Corporation, USA</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Hypoxia inducible factor-1<italic>&#x003b1;</italic> (HIF-1<italic>&#x003b1;</italic>)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">4 &#x000d7; 4&#x02009;min microwave in citric acid with 20&#x02009;min standing</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">1&#x0002f;1000</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x00023;ab463-100, Abcam Ltd, UK</td></tr><tr><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">Vascular endothelial growth factor (VEGF)</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">3 &#x000d7; 4&#x02009;min microwave in Tris-HCL with 10&#x02009;min standing</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">1&#x0002f;100</td><td align="left" valign="top" charoff="50">&#x00023;MS-350-P1, NeoMarkers Inc., USA</td></tr></tbody></table></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>